  "id": "section-928",
  "title": "在文化革命中立新功",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-308.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>308)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　老干部过去有功劳，但是不能靠吃老本，要很好地在无产阶级文化大革命运动中锻炼改造自己，要立新功，立新劳。<br>\n<br>\n<p>　　（转引自六月一日《人民日报》）</p>\n<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-307.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-309.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
